   ],
   "text": "Our off-site backup supplier has told us that, on Day 91, files were copied out of one of its storage systems, which holds copies of our members’ records. We do not yet know whether our members’ copies were among them. We stopped sending copies to the supplier on Day 92, the morning it first told us, and told every member that day. Where a member finds that anyone’s information may have been taken, that member will contact them directly, under the Compact’s rules. Next update: Day 96 by 12:00, or sooner if we learn more. Questions: the Compact’s information line (game).",
